## Signature

- Provided by: **Big Pickle (opencode/big-pickle)** — 2026-10-22
- Method: public internet research of the official LongCat API Platform change log and pay-as-you-go
  pricing pages, the official OpenCode Zen model catalogue (confirming no `longcat-2.5` entry and
  only `longcat-2.5-preview-free`), the Meituan Hugging Face organisation listing (newest
  checkpoints are LongCat-2.0, LongCat-2.0-FP8, LongCat-2.0-INT8, LongCat-Flash-Lite-Sparse), the
  Meituan September 2026 ecosystem/pricing report, and launch coverage from TechNode, Post-Cutoff,
  Creative AI News and a September 2026 Automatica Press verification piece — all of which agree
  that no GA 2.5 exists and that no benchmark table or weights were published for the 2.5 line.
  Scores are withheld because zero verified public benchmark numbers exist for this exact id.
- Future sources: add a new file next to this one, e.g. `GPT_5.md`, using the same headings.
